ets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete: node1 was healthy before restart, acknowledged the restart, returned with a different boot identity corroborated by lifecycle observations, recovered SSH and policy state, and passed the five-attempt lockout test again.","limitations":["The timeout test checked recovery after 305 seconds but did not probe immediately before the 300-second boundary; exact duration is therefore supported jointly by the effective unlock_time=300 configuration and the observed locked-to-recovered transition.","Some numeric authentication return-code text was redacted, though visible denial/success output, failure ledgers, explicit assertions, and zero command exits preserve the behavioral result.","Lifecycle snapshots do not inventory /root, so they do not independently confirm the final presence or absence of the rollback file created by cmd-ec1a9685bc6546dc; no later command removes it."]}
